           <p class="post-author">
            <span class="info">Posted by <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/author/cromwellryan/" title="Posts by cromwellryan ">cromwellryan</a> in <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/agile/" title="View all posts in Agile" rel="category tag">Agile</a>, <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/community/" title="View all posts in Community" rel="category tag">Community</a> | <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/2011/05/good-books-for-the-softer-side-of-agile/#respond" class="comments"  title="Comment on Good Books for the Softer Side of Agile"><span class="dsq-postid" rel="900 http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/2011/05/good-books-for-the-softer-side-of-agile/">No Comments</span></a>              </span>
