           <p class="post-author">
            <span class="info">Posted by <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/author/cromwellryan/" title="Posts by cromwellryan ">cromwellryan</a> in <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/agile/" title="View all posts in Agile" rel="category tag">Agile</a>, <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/community/" title="View all posts in Community" rel="category tag">Community</a>, <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/craftsmanship/" title="View all posts in Craftsmanship" rel="category tag">Craftsmanship</a>, <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/scrum/" title="View all posts in Scrum" rel="category tag">Scrum</a>, <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/tdd/" title="View all posts in TDD" rel="category tag">TDD</a>, <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/testing/" title="View all posts in Testing" rel="category tag">Testing</a> | <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/2011/03/cincy-clean-coders-code-you-can-show-your-friends/#comments" class="comments"  title="Comment on Cincy Clean Coders &ndash; Code You Can Show Your Friends"><span class="dsq-postid" rel="898 http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/2011/03/cincy-clean-coders-code-you-can-show-your-friends/">3 Comments</span></a>              </span>
           </p>
