            <span class="info">Posted by <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/author/cromwellryan/" title="Posts by cromwellryan ">cromwellryan</a> in <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/agile/" title="View all posts in Agile" rel="category tag">Agile</a>, <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/community/" title="View all posts in Community" rel="category tag">Community</a>, <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/scrum/" title="View all posts in Scrum" rel="category tag">Scrum</a>, <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/speaking/" title="View all posts in Speaking" rel="category tag">Speaking</a> | <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/2011/02/cincy-day-of-agile-2011-is-open-for-registration/#respond" class="comments"  title="Comment on Cincy Day Of Agile 2011 is Open for Registration"><span class="dsq-postid" rel="890 http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/2011/02/cincy-day-of-agile-2011-is-open-for-registration/">No Comments</span></a>              </span>
