           <p class="post-author">
            <span class="info">Posted by <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/author/cromwellryan/" title="Posts by cromwellryan ">cromwellryan</a> in <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/agile/" title="View all posts in Agile" rel="category tag">Agile</a>, <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/community/" title="View all posts in Community" rel="category tag">Community</a>, <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/craftsmanship/" title="View all posts in Craftsmanship" rel="category tag">Craftsmanship</a>, <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/tdd/" title="View all posts in TDD" rel="category tag">TDD</a>, <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/uncategorized/" title="View all posts in Uncategorized" rel="category tag">Uncategorized</a> | <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/2011/02/expanding-quality-dev-practices-clean-coders-club/#comments" class="comments"  title="Comment on Expanding Quality Dev Practices: Clean Coders"><span class="dsq-postid" rel="885 http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/2011/02/expanding-quality-dev-practices-clean-coders-club/">1 Comment</span></a>              </span>
