            <span class="info">Posted by <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/author/cromwellryan/" title="Posts by cromwellryan ">cromwellryan</a> in <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/net/" title="View all posts in .Net" rel="category tag">.Net</a>, <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/community/" title="View all posts in Community" rel="category tag">Community</a> | <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/2010/08/where-did-alt-net-go/#comments" class="comments"  title="Comment on Where did Alt.Net go?"><span class="dsq-postid" rel="798 http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/index.php/2010/08/where-did-alt-net-go/">2 Comments</span></a>              </span>
