          <p>These last few weeks have seen a flurry of emotions from the .Net community.&#160; It appears that a few product releases and a presumptive priority change for IronRuby have caused the world to come crashing down and passengers of the .Net ship to jump overboard.&#160; I’m glad I don’t work for these emotionally unstable individuals, [...]</p>

